  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICIS - Improving Investment Climate &amp; InstituionalStrenghtening in BiH - Inspections reform in BiH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICIS - Improving Investment Climate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reforming inspections and development of interoperability IT system   that would allow better functionality of inspections and their        related services.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reforming inspections and development of interoperability IT system   that would allow better functionality of inspections and their        related services.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Project is to improve investment climate and reduce costs and risks of conducting business in BiH. The objective is to be achieved through further improving the inspection system while devoting special attention to areas such as risk-based inspections and checklists; improving inspection transparency and predictability; market surveillance, veterinary, and food safety inspections. Further streamlining and reorganizing inspections in accordance with EU requirements; providing for interoperability inspection system needed to carry out risk-based inspections, data and information exchange. The Project aims at improving quality infrastructure and the inspection system and to bring inspections closer to EU practices. The Project aims at speeding up business registration and at developing an action plan to reform the bankruptcy processes.</narrative>
  </description>
